        <element kind="staticText" x="0" y="85" width="782" height="25" fontName="Arial" fontSize="8" hTextAlign="Center"><text><![CDATA[Review findings against schedules, raw punches, leave, corrections, and employee coverage. A finding is not a final absence or disciplinary determination.]]></text></element>
